<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When Sasame called Hanzaki a traitor</font>

66
00:03:12,420 --> 00:03:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew that Sasame had ties to a group
that was on Orochimaru's side.</font>

