<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Master Jiraiya!</font>

74
00:03:47,950 --> 00:03:51,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame did it only because
she wanted to see her cousin.</font>

75
