but to split up into three.</font>

132
00:08:21,230 --> 00:08:24,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My instinct tells me
it's the middle one!</font>

133
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:25,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

134
00:08:25,810 --> 00:08:26,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck?!</font>

135
00:08:27,860 --> 00:08:30,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At times like this it's especially
important to move carefully...</font>

136
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:43,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right I'll go this way!</font>

137
00:08:44,710 --> 00:08:45,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it?!</font>

138
00:08:45,710 --> 00:08:49,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what's so different from
my instinct and that, Pervy Sage?</font>

139
00:08:49,090 --> 00:08:51,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it's a question of feeling...</font>

140
00:08:52,470 --> 00:08:56,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you haven't found anything
after 30 minutes come back.</font>

141
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it?</font>

142
00:08:57,470 --> 00:08:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

143
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:04,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Sakura, the two of you
should proceed together.</font>

144
00:09:05,310 --> 00:09:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, from this point forward
it's the first avenue of hell.</font>

145
00:09:09,230 --> 00:09:11,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A demon might appear
or a snake might appear.</font>

146
00:09:11,570 --> 00:09:13,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take them on mindfully!</font>

147
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup!</font>

148
00:09:16,780 --> 00:09:17,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand!</font>

149
00:09:19,950 --> 00:09:22,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going down the middle!</font>

150
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'm going this way...</font>

151
00:09:25,660 --> 00:09:26,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See ya...</font>

152
00:09:39,390 --> 00:09:42,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... the smell of face powder.</font>

153
00:09:48,270 --> 00:09:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm being invited in...</font>

154
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:54,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case it might be good fun
to accept the invitation.</font>

155
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

156
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:18,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because guests would be
arriving from far away</font>

157
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:23,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was directed by Orochimaru-sama
to entertain.</font>

158
00:10:24,430 --> 00:10:27,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm guessing
it's a type of fox raccoon ghost...</font>

159
00:10:28,100 --> 00:10:31,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're saying
I'm some raccoon or fox</font>

160
00:10:31,060 --> 00:10:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you ought to come over here
and check to see if I have a tail or not.</font>

161
00:10:37,190 --> 00:10:41,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, this path was right on...</font>

162
00:10:42,370 --> 00:10:44,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about yours, Naruto?</font>

163
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:49,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, be careful!</font>

164
00:10:50,290 --> 00:10:53,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no telling what sort
of traps there might be...</font>

165
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

166
00:10:55,090 --> 00:10:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Oh?!
— Naruto?!</font>

167
00:10:58,510 --> 00:11:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you were the one who
said to be careful!</font>

168
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:03,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was an ingenious trap floor!</font>

169
00:11:07,770 --> 00:11:08,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

170
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:10,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is next!</font>

171
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:14,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

172
00:11:17,860 --> 00:11:18,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

173
00:11:25,370 --> 00:11:27,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my fault...</font>

174
00:11:28,580 --> 00:11:29,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

175
00:11:29,750 --> 00:11:31,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell...</font>

176
00:11:35,880 --> 00:11:37,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't get out...</font>

177
00:11:38,130 --> 00:11:39,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?!</font>

178
00:11:39,420 --> 00:11:42,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You screamed in such
a misleading way I totally thought...</font>

179
00:11:43,050 --> 00:11:45,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me a hand!</font>

180
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're really a handful!</font>

181
00:11:49,890 --> 00:11:50,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You saved me...</font>

182
00:11:50,940 --> 00:11:53,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really! I'll go first!</font>

183
00:12:05,570 --> 00:12:07,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

184
00:12:08,910 --> 00:12:11,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right now.</font>

185
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

186
00:12:16,290 --> 00:12:17,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

187
00:12:29,140 --> 00:12:30,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

188
00:12:37,020 --> 00:12:38,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

189
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:41,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

190
00:12:42,190 --> 00:12:44,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

191
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:47,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto?! Are you all right?</font>

192
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:51,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry about me.</font>

193
00:12:51,830 --> 00:12:54,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You need to hurry and
get out of this trap hallway!</font>

194
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:55,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

195
00:12:56,130 --> 00:13:00,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said go! I'll follow behind for sure!</font>

196
00:13:01,340 --> 00:13:02,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?</font>

197
00:13:02,510 --> 00:13:05,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... I'll catch up in no time!</font>

198
00:13:11,430 --> 00:13:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'd better come no matter what.</font>

199
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:14,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a promise you know...</font>

200
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:25,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The alcohol doesn't seem
tampered with.</font>

201
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:29,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what kind of plot has been prepared...?</font>

202
00:13:33,330 --> 00:13:35,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I'd expect from
the Village Hidden in Sound...</font>

203
00:13:35,830 --> 00:13:39,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you planning to put a Jutsu
on me using music?</font>

204
00:13:40,500 --> 00:13:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The music isn't only for guests.
It's for myself...</font>

205
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:47,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

206
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:50,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you play for your heart?</font>

207
00:13:54,350 --> 00:13:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Music for my own funeral...</font>

208
00:14:06,450 --> 00:14:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Trying to seduce me....
You've underestimated this Jiraiya!</font>

209
00:14:35,060 --> 00:14:40,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Escorting the guest to
the underworld is my last mission.</font>

210
00:14:43,020 --> 00:14:44,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A suspended ceiling?!</font>

211
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:51,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to hurry up
and get out of this place!</font>

212
00:14:52,950 --> 00:14:54,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

213
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is torture!</font>

214
00:14:59,250 --> 00:15:00,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell?!</font>

215
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:02,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me a hand!</font>

216
00:15:02,790 --> 00:15:05,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We need to build up our Chakra
and create the Rasengan!</font>

217
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:07,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be absurd!</font>

218
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:10,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't stretch
our bodies beyond this!</font>

219
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:13,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My muscles are cramping up!</font>

220
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:15,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man! I've gotta do something...</font>

221
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:17,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What!
— Huh?!</font>

222
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:20,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

223
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:21,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Water?!
— Water!</font>

224
00:15:34,660 --> 00:15:36,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like I've been saved.</font>

225
00:15:37,910 --> 00:15:39,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, get outta my way!</font>

226
00:15:40,330 --> 00:15:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's you, Naruto.</font>

227
00:15:42,830 --> 00:15:46,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gamakichi, is there
a way out somewhere?</font>

228
00:15:46,250 --> 00:15:51,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't know!
I was flushed down here too.</font>

229
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:55,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's no good...</font>

230
00:15:55,970 --> 00:15:57,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, are you all right?</font>

231
00:15:57,900 --> 00:15:59,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How could I be all right!</font>

232
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto's taking a long time.</font>

233
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:27,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe I should go back...</font>

234
00:17:08,790 --> 00:17:12,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's admirable that
you made it this far, Sakura.</font>

235
00:17:13,170 --> 00:17:14,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that Kabuto's voice?!</font>

236
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:17,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it ironic?</font>

237
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">During the Chunin Exam
in the Village Hidden in the Leaves</font>

238
00:17:22,600 --> 00:17:25,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you were the only one
that dragged the team down</font>

239
00:17:25,350 --> 00:17:27,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but yet you're the one
to make it this far.</font>

240
00:17:28,270 --> 00:17:29,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not by myself!</font>

241
00:17:30,150 --> 00:17:32,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and Master Jiraiya
will be here right away!</font>

242
00:17:33,650 --> 00:17:36,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Sasuke?
He is all right, isn't he?</font>

243
00:17:37,740 --> 00:17:41,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shouldn't you be worried about
Naruto and Master Jiraiya</font>

244
00:17:41,660 --> 00:17:44,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and not Sasuke?</font>

245
00:17:47,290 --> 00:17:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it may very well be that those two
are no longer in this world anymore.</font>

246
00:17:53,130 --> 00:17:54,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

247
00:17:56,720 --> 00:18:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way Master Jiraiya and Naruto
would be taken down that easily!</font>

248
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:02,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if that's so?</font>

249
00:18:03,310 --> 00:18:07,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe you dragged Naruto
down like you always do?</font>

250
00:18:10,190 --> 00:18:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I'm right...</font>

251
00:18:12,770 --> 00:18:13,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

252
00:18:19,780 --> 00:18:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're worried
you should go and see...</font>

253
00:18:24,330 --> 00:18:27,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or perhaps you're afraid
of me attacking</font>

254
00:18:27,330 --> 00:18:29,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you can't come out
from behind the pillar.</font>

255
00:18:30,130 --> 00:18:34,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If someone like you were
on my team</font>

256
00:18:34,630 --> 00:18:37,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know how many lives
I would need.</font>

257
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:38,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can too...</font>

258
00:18:39,130 --> 00:18:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can too!</font>

259
00:18:50,270 --> 00:18:51,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Substitution Jutsu?!</font>

260
00:18:54,110 --> 00:18:55,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Substitution again?!</font>

261
00:18:59,950 --> 00:19:02,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can too...
When I fight I fight!</font>

262
00:19:03,490 --> 00:19:05,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I thought, this is all you've got...</font>

263
00:19:07,950 --> 00:19:10,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time I put an end to this.</font>

264
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:15,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't keep Orochimaru-sama waiting
for no reason any longer you see.</font>

265
00:19:16,510 --> 00:19:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru?!</font>

266
00:19:26,310 --> 00:19:28,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... shall we see...</font>

267
00:19:31,140 --> 00:19:33,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just who will be stealing
scrolls from whom?</font>

268
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll fight to the death!</font>

269
00:20:06,430 --> 00:20:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! I'm different from how I was... then!</font>

270
00:20:13,020 --> 00:20:14,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if that's true...</font>

271
00:20:27,580 --> 00:20:28,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be...</font>

272
00:20:31,580 --> 00:20:34,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you put up a bluff
I can foresee...</font>

273
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are already... finished.</font>

274
00:21:12,790 --> 00:21:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

275
00:21:12,790 --> 00:21:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">when I recalled the parts one by one,</font></font></font></font>

276
00:21:17,560 --> 00:21:23,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">subete wakatteita kigashite ita no ni</font></font></font></font>

277
00:21:17,560 --> 00:21:23,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I felt as though I had understood everything</font></font></font></font>

278
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:28,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">iroaseta kotoba wa</font></font></font></font>

279
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:28,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">faded words</font></font></font></font>

280
00:21:28,370 --> 00:21:34,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">boku no sugu soba ni oite atta</font></font></font></font>

281
00:21:28,370 --> 00:21:34,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">which I kept so close to me</font></font></font></font>

282
00:21:34,740 --> 00:21:39,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kotae no denai yoru to</font></font></font></font>

283
00:21:34,740 --> 00:21:39,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">speechless nights,</font></font></font></font>

284
00:21:40,320 --> 00:21:44,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a hint of warmth,</font></font></font></font>

285
00:21:40,360 --> 00:21:44,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitokira no nukumori to</font></font></font></font>

286
00:21:46,070 --> 00:21:51,200
